# Notice of Public Meeting of the North Carolina Advisory Committee to the U.S. Commission on Civil Rights

Agency

U.S. Commission on Civil Rights

Action

Notice of public meeting

Date

Monday, April 28, 2025, from 1 p.m. to 2:30 p.m. Eastern Time

## Summary

The North Carolina Advisory Committee will hold a virtual public meeting to discuss its report on civil rights and the child welfare system in North Carolina.

## Agenda

1. Welcome and roll call

2. Committee discussion

3. Public comment

4. Next steps

5. Adjournment
